id: mingle
name: Mingle
prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Persuasion
requiresSkill: persuasion
requiresRanks: 2
sessionLimit: 1
timeCost: 2 Hours
# What it gives is the ARC's to tell: said on the card. Affection Ratings are not in this system.
effectNote: gains any information the Characters of the settlement have relevant to their situation - and used enough times may raise their Affection Rating with its Individuals or Factions
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Two hours among the locals of a settlement: whatever they know that bears on your situation, and -
  often enough - their Affection for you.
text: >
  Mingle: You socialize with the locals, learning from them and improving their opinions of you.
  –Prerequisite: 2+ Skill Ranks in Persuasion
  –Session Limit: 1
  –Time Cost: 2 Hours
  –Effect: You enter a settlement and spend your time getting to know the people there. You gain any
  information Characters there may have relevant to your situation and may increase your Affection
  Rating with the Individuals or Factions at that settlement if you use the Mingle Maneuver enough times.

---

# Offered on the Adventure tab to whoever has 2+ Ranks in Persuasion. Once the two hours are spent the
# card says what it gives; the information, and how many times is "enough" for the Affection Rating, are
# the ARC's - Affection Ratings are not built.
